 "statement": "Unsigned native fixed controls for partial sweep/worklist polynomial extraction. Indexed worklist returns original-checked and signed-row-replayed roots for all13 declared Fp101 public arity2 targets; original worklist returns Unsupported for those13, original sweep caps for13, indexed sweep returns5 roots and8 modeled-reservation caps. Both schedules return the same root/decision trace for each completed comparator case and all four actual-field q1/k2/arity2 arms replay +column1+column2. Reverse64 chain records4160 vs191 equation revisions while both retain4160 selection scans; forced backtrack retains a failed branch and undo. No complete-cost, timing, live-memory, huge-original-base discovery, independent signature or exponent conclusion."
